      "value": "@{5f3df2f75af9f322b0f66e1b|full_name}\n\nHas it really been lifted? When I try to add notes to people on VRC and reopen their profile, the note disappears. When I try add a note on the website, I get the following error: \"\"\"Player Notes\n\nUpdate Player Notes Failed. You're not allowed to create more than 2099 user notesǃ \"\"\"\n\nEdit 16h later: The limit seems to be 2098 now?",
